t leads, 1.2\u00d7 the usual rate, most often the queen's rook (54%). The reply wins it outright 31% of the time. Take it with a rook.","Material changes hands for you on d5 and c6: build pressure there.","They win material on d4 and f3: keep those squares defended.","Look for the skewer: it appears 1.8\u00d7 as often as usual in this opening."],"similar":[],"family":"Queen's Pawn Game"}